      introPassTT: ["Welcome to {track}! Eight kilometres past the lakes, just you and the clock.","Here we are on the Road of the Seven Lakes. {cps} checkpoints between you and the finish past Lake Escondido.","Welcome to {track}! No rivals this time, only the clock and the bends by the water."],
